===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{lb|en|pharmaceutical effect}} Tending to destroy or capable of destroying [[microbe]]s.
#: {{hypo|en|antibiotic#Adjective|antifungal#Adjective|antimycotic#Adjective|;|antiviral#Adjective<!--viruses are often, although not always, classed as microorganisms-->}}
# {{lb|en|pharmaceutical effect}} Inhibiting the growth of microbes.
#: {{syn|en|microbiostatic#Adjective}}
#: {{hypo|en|bacteriostatic#Adjective|fungistatic#Adjective|mycostatic#Adjective}}
# {{lb|en|pharmaceutical effect}} Preventing or counteracting the [[pathogenic]] action of microbes.

