===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An agent (drug or other substance) that destroys microbes (i.e., [[kill off|kills off]] a [[population]] of them).
#: {{hypo|en|antibiotic#Noun|antifungal#Noun|antimycotic#Noun|;|antiviral#Noun<!--viruses are often, although not always, classed as microorganisms-->}}
# An agent (drug or other substance) that inhibits the growth of microbes but does not kill their whole population.
#: {{syn|en|microbiostatic#Noun}}
#: {{hypo|en|bacteriostatic#Noun|fungistatic#Noun|mycostatic#Noun}}
# An agent (drug or other substance) that counteracts the pathogenic action of microbes.

